{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45274","headline":"送吴冯游京 · 皎然","name":"送吴冯游京","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"北期何意促，蕙草夜来繁。\n清月思淮水，春风望国门。\n此时休旋逸，万里忽飞翻。\n若忆山阴会，孤琴爲我援。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45274.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45274","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}